  "description": "Pure C# high-performance MySQL ADO.NET driver. Zero third-party dependencies, full async/await, 2~3× faster batch DML than MySql.Data/MySqlConnector with unique Pipelined Batch Execution. MIT license. Supports net45~net10, MySQL 5.x~9.0+, OceanBase, TiDB.",
